# Build context for Dockerfile.llm.rebase ONLY (BuildKit prefers
# "<dockerfile-name>.dockerignore" over the shared .dockerignore).
#
# This build copies one shell script onto an existing image. It needs no model
# weights at all, and without this line it would ship ~28GB of them to the
# daemon first -- an hour of transfer for files no layer reads.
